    "name": "Exark",
    "steam_appid": 3435610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/7d043eaf5baee507e5af81c8282556ec.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><strong>Exark is a run-based engine builder / autobattler about building a thriving city aboard your gigantic ark-ship on your voyage to the rim of the world. Maximise your resource production, survive the trials of your perilous journey, and lead your people to safety.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6eb69253b9c1ed77242f361b4ace97de.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The world-machine is broken. The sun has become a baleful orb of radiation. The Celestial Bureaucracy is in disarray. You, the Captain-General of a great ark, must lead your people rimwards, away from the gaze of the green sun.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/b1773b66506605386f6c4c0534c4bb02.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=496 /></span></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ff41f42034bc52d72bdbb3aa854acfb.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Survive your voyage by maximising your production of valuable resources:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  <strong>Food</strong> fuels your buildings, and stockpiles increase their cycle speed.</li><li>  <strong>Production</strong> allows you to construct more buildings on your ever-expanding ark.</li><li>  <strong>Inspiration</strong> enables you to hire crew members with unique skills to improve your buildings.</li><li>  ... or buy buildings and hire crew members outright by spending <strong>Gold</strong> at the dockside markets.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/7bb74c3a203c7e26a079a748d06dc76e.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/705994790f16ba0c7d351ad6ece5ce9b.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><br>Pick between a range of Great Houses, each with their own unique ark, buildings and crewmates. Command House Arioch's golden flagship, the Diurnal Ark, and harness the expertise of their engineers and artisans - or choose House Mnesis, whose ark, the titanic Shepherd Moon, is a motherlode of precious raw materials.<br><br>Exploit the Houses' specialities, mitigate their shortcomings, and lead them to a safe refuge on the rim.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/794405464c8aa35fc6f85c38006df4fc.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ad2d40822c3fb29b37517df104e827e.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ad2d40822c3fb29b37517df104e827e.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=27 height=34 /></picture></span> - Explore a vibrant world, with diverse biomes and settlements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6d0e9323ba43a39d59478b01374535f2.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" width=31 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6d0e9323ba43a39d59478b01374535f2.webm?t=1755244755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> - Choose between 5 Great Houses to lead to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/3c161104a0da61379549d61bffbe00af.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/3c161104a0da61379549d61bffbe00af.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=33 height=32 /></picture></span> - Cook up the perfect city with &gt;100 buildings &amp; crew members.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/721eb22b9ed251f3aff736f5c501606b.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/721eb22b9ed251f3aff736f5c501606b.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=33 /></picture></span> - Play at your own pace with pause and time acceleration.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/41fb6bd88de413eed6179201aa044320.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/41fb6bd88de413eed6179201aa044320.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=30 height=31 /></picture></span> - Multiple routes to victory, either focusing on peaceful production or blasting your enemies into submission.",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/7d043eaf5baee507e5af81c8282556ec.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><strong>Exark is a run-based engine builder / autobattler about building a thriving city aboard your gigantic ark-ship on your voyage to the rim of the world. Maximise your resource production, survive the trials of your perilous journey, and lead your people to safety.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6eb69253b9c1ed77242f361b4ace97de.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The world-machine is broken. The sun has become a baleful orb of radiation. The Celestial Bureaucracy is in disarray. You, the Captain-General of a great ark, must lead your people rimwards, away from the gaze of the green sun.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/b1773b66506605386f6c4c0534c4bb02.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=496 /></span></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ff41f42034bc52d72bdbb3aa854acfb.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Survive your voyage by maximising your production of valuable resources:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  <strong>Food</strong> fuels your buildings, and stockpiles increase their cycle speed.</li><li>  <strong>Production</strong> allows you to construct more buildings on your ever-expanding ark.</li><li>  <strong>Inspiration</strong> enables you to hire crew members with unique skills to improve your buildings.</li><li>  ... or buy buildings and hire crew members outright by spending <strong>Gold</strong> at the dockside markets.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/7bb74c3a203c7e26a079a748d06dc76e.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/705994790f16ba0c7d351ad6ece5ce9b.avif?t=1755244755\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><br>Pick between a range of Great Houses, each with their own unique ark, buildings and crewmates. Command House Arioch's golden flagship, the Diurnal Ark, and harness the expertise of their engineers and artisans - or choose House Mnesis, whose ark, the titanic Shepherd Moon, is a motherlode of precious raw materials.<br><br>Exploit the Houses' specialities, mitigate their shortcomings, and lead them to a safe refuge on the rim.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/794405464c8aa35fc6f85c38006df4fc.webp?t=1755244755\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ad2d40822c3fb29b37517df104e827e.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/1ad2d40822c3fb29b37517df104e827e.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=27 height=34 /></picture></span> - Explore a vibrant world, with diverse biomes and settlements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6d0e9323ba43a39d59478b01374535f2.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" width=31 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/6d0e9323ba43a39d59478b01374535f2.webm?t=1755244755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> - Choose between 5 Great Houses to lead to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/3c161104a0da61379549d61bffbe00af.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/3c161104a0da61379549d61bffbe00af.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=33 height=32 /></picture></span> - Cook up the perfect city with &gt;100 buildings &amp; crew members.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/721eb22b9ed251f3aff736f5c501606b.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/721eb22b9ed251f3aff736f5c501606b.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=33 /></picture></span> - Play at your own pace with pause and time acceleration.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/41fb6bd88de413eed6179201aa044320.poster.avif?t=1755244755\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435610/extras/41fb6bd88de413eed6179201aa044320.apng?t=1755244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=30 height=31 /></picture></span> - Multiple routes to victory, either focusing on peaceful production or blasting your enemies into submission.",
